# One input per line. A blank line and a `#` line are skipped, and `~` on its
# own is the empty string.

# --- the two uses that are written down anywhere ----------------------------
$vocabularies.lifecycle_state
$vocabularies.audience
$package.optional.forbids

# --- what the grammar refuses -----------------------------------------------
~
$
# An address is not a reference. The message says which of the two this is.
vocabularies.lifecycle_state
# A root and nothing in it. The root set is closed, so this could only ever
# mean the whole block, and no position takes one.
$vocabularies
$package
# The root set is closed and case-sensitive.
$facets.status
$Vocabularies.audience
$.audience
$vocabularies.
$vocabularies..audience
